# Documentation-First

Before making significant changes:

1. Read [AGENTS.md](AGENTS.md) for project structure and conventions
2. Check relevant .cursor/rules for the affected file types
3. When adding features: update AGENTS.md if structure changes, add dartdoc for new public APIs
4. When modifying game logic: ensure game_state.dart and game_screen.dart docs stay accurate
5. When adding/changing code: ensure test coverage stays ≥90%
